increase of the spam I receive. I have heard that it is pretty easy for
spammers to harvest email address from mailing lists; just join it, and wait
for posts. Additionally, our messages are archived
here<http://www.lojban.org/no/lists/lojban-list/msg29599.html>with our
email addresses undisguised; perfect for email harvesters.
           
